// Launchpad 300.30.3 - WEEK 8: The 30-Day Lead Amplifier part 2 (Keys 4 and 5, the video bank, the letter bank,
// how 30 appraisals become 3 listings, the first listing push, Checkpoint 2).
// Built from Jess Densley's 30-Day Lead Amplifier workbook and slides, the Agent Dashboard workbook (Targets vs Actuals,
